@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_OhYouLikeHotSprings
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_OhYouLikeHotSprings::
	.string "Oh, you like hot springs, do you?\p"
	.string "That's surprising for one as young\n"
	.string "as you.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsNeverRunDry
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsNeverRunDry::
	.string "We draw as much hot water as we need,\n"
	.string "and yet the hot springs never run dry.\p"
	.string "Isn't it magical?\p"
	.string "These hot springs appear near active\n"
	.string "volcanoes. Veins of water under the\l"
	.string "ground are heated by magma to well up\l"
	.string "as hot springs.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_PokemonNippedBackside
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_PokemonNippedBackside::
	.string "Being buried in this hot sand is…\n"
	.string "Sigh…\p"
	.string "So warm and heavenly…\p"
	.string "Eh? Gyaah! Ouch!\p"
	.string "A POKéMON nipped my backside!$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_BatheInHotSpringsEveryDay
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_BatheInHotSpringsEveryDay::
	.string "I bathe in the hot springs every day.\p"
	.string "I want to become a beautiful and strong\n"
	.string "GYM LEADER like FLANNERY.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_IfPokemonInHotSprings
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_IfPokemonInHotSprings::
	.string "If people put POKéMON in hot springs,\n"
	.string "it might be seriously strange.\p"
	.string "Why, it might be an electric bath, or\n"
	.string "a bubble bath, or even a lava bath…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsClaims
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_HotSpringsClaims::
	.string "They're claiming that these hot springs\n"
	.string "are good for calming nervous tension,\l"
	.string "relieving aching muscles, solving\l"
	.string "romantic problems, and attracting\l"
	.string "money…$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_HerbShopSign
Hoenn_LavaridgeTown_Text_HerbShopSign::
	.string "POKéMON HERB SHOP\n"
	.string "“Bitter taste--better cure!”$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/LavaridgeTown/scripts.inc: LavaridgeTown_Text_GymSign
